# Tracer: a failed equality chain keeps each actual adjacent check.
# Before: neither equals sign exposed its retained check at the source.
# Now: the first equality has its own proof; the second has its own rejection.
# Boundary: the chain and forall are unproved; the final clause is unchecked.
# Evidence: node src/reading/web/tests/failed-chain-proofs.cjs <fixtures>
forall z R:
    z > 0
    =>:
        z + 0 = z = 0
        z = z
